Molecular Car icon snapshot
Ketcher 3.18.0, official tag v3.18.0, commit f4f013e1855b71b0cbd37fc79d55b0cbe51c2371.
The Ketcher SVG files are copied without changes. Their paths and SHA-256 are recorded in manifest.json.
The template-8 SVG comes from the local Molecular Car C60 source extension.
workshop-* SVG files are new original UI drawings, not third-party artwork.
Runtime rendering normalizes monochrome solid fill/stroke to currentColor and renders at 24px, preserving viewBox and geometry.
The icons.js module is generated from these fixed SVG snapshots and adds no package dependency.
